      "id": "browser_state",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1120,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 135,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "text": "STATE + CLEANUP\nready[2] gates compare; busy disables edits/reset.\nChanging a clip, frame or mirror setting marks results stale.\nClear all remounts both selectors and revokes capture URLs;\nresets files, timestamps, mirror, errors, results and selection.\nSelector cleanup releases source object URLs.",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
