      "originalText": "STATE + CLEANUP\nready[2] gates compare; busy disables edits/reset.\nChanging a clip, frame or mirror setting marks results stale.\nClear all remounts both selectors and revokes capture URLs;\nresets files, timestamps, mirror, errors, results and selection.\nSelector cleanup releases source object URLs.",
