      "fontSize": 19,
      "text": "1. Lazy-load pretrained models, then reuse\nAutoProcessor + PyTorch eval()/inference_mode()\nCUDA if available, otherwise CPU.\nCPU threads capped at min(4, os.cpu_count()).\nWeights cached in .cache/huggingface by default.",
