    {
      "id": "math_formula",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 340,
      "y": 1925,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 180,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "text": "u = A - B; v = C - B\nangle = degrees(acos(clip(\n  dot(u,v) / (|u| |v|), -1, 1)))\n\nElbow: shoulder → elbow → wrist\nUpper arm: hip → shoulder → elbow\nBoth sides: up to 4 measurements.\nDegenerate vectors → omit + warn.",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 500011,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 520011,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "frameId": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "originalText": "u = A - B; v = C - B\nangle = degrees(acos(clip(\n  dot(u,v) / (|u| |v|), -1, 1)))\n\nElbow: shoulder → elbow → wrist\nUpper arm: hip → shoulder → elbow\nBoth sides: up to 4 measurements.\nDegenerate vectors → omit + warn.",
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "math_delta",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2160,
      "width": 860,
      "height": 142.5,
      "fontSize": 19,
      "text": "FEEDBACK + ORDER\ndelta = attempt angle - reference angle\nNegative elbow delta = more bent; positive = more extended.\nUpper arm: larger/smaller angle relative to torso.\n|delta| < 10° uses a display-tolerance message.\nSort descending by absolute difference; round to 0.1°.",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 500012,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 520012,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "frameId": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "originalText": "FEEDBACK + ORDER\ndelta = attempt angle - reference angle\nNegative elbow delta = more bent; positive = more extended.\nUpper arm: larger/smaller angle relative to torso.\n|delta| < 10° uses a display-tolerance message.\nSort descending by absolute difference; round to 0.1°.",
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "math_normalize",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 2340,
