      "text": "NORMALIZED OVERLAY\nCenter = midpoint of hips.\nScale = distance(shoulder midpoint, hip midpoint).\np' = (p - center) / scale; preserves confidence.\nRequires both shoulders and hips + nonzero torso length.\nMissing anchors → normalized pose null + warning.",
